  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><hi rend="allcaps">Fifth Time.</hi><lb/>
               <placeName ref="namedentities.xml#haymarket">Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market</placeName>.<lb/>
               This <hi rend="allcaps">Evening</hi>, <date when="1811-06-14">Friday June 14, 1811</date>.<lb/>
               Will be presented, an Historical Play, in Three Acts, call'd The<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_royal_oak">Royal Oak.</title></bibl><lb/>
               With entire New Scenery, Dresses and Decorations.<lb/>
               The <hi rend="allcaps">New Musick</hi> Composed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mi_ke">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Kelly</hi></persName>.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_wi_el">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lewes</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ge_sm">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hodson</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hemings</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Stokes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ed_ey">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Eyre</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hillington</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Paine</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Houghton</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Widdicombe</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem>Messrs. <actor>Brown,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_ca">Caulfield,</actor> <actor>Diether,</actor> <actor>Eames,</actor> <actor>Field,</actor> <actor>Gray,</actor> <actor>Griffith,</actor> <actor>Hall,</actor> <actor>Harrison,</actor> <actor>Lawson,</actor><lb/>
                     <actor>Oddwell,</actor> <actor>Robert,</actor> <actor>Sherriff,</actor> <actor>Thomson,</actor> <actor>Terry,</actor> <actor>Willoughby,</actor> &amp;c.</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mallinson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">R. Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Martin</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Shaw</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mi">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Minton</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Linton</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem>Mr. <actor><hi rend="allcaps">Miller</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Silver</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Salker</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Taylor</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Thomas</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Wilson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_barnes">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Barnes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Wheatley</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Stokes</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Haughton</hi>,</actor></castItem> <castItem><actor>Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Kendall</hi>,</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ju_gl">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Glover</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="italic">The Dresses by Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Tobin</hi> and <persName ref="namedentities.xml#an_sm">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi></persName>.</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="italic">The Scenery designed, and executed by <persName ref="namedentities.xml#j_de">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">De Maria</hi></persName>, and Assistants.</hi><lb/>
               To which will be added. the Musical Piece call'd<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_hunter_of_the_alps">Hunter of the Alps.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Felix,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_wi_el">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Rosalvi,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Cooper</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Jeronymo,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Florio,</role> <actor>Master <hi rend="allcaps">Martin</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Juho,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">C. Carr</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Juan,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Paine</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Baptista,</role> <actor>Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Noble</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Marco,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ge_sm">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Huntsmen,</role> Messrs. <actor><hi rend="allcaps">Lewes</hi></actor> and <actor><hi rend="allcaps">Hodson.</hi></actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor>Widdicombe,</actor> <actor>Cross,</actor> <actor>Brown,</actor> &amp;c.<lb/>
                     Messdms. <actor>Stokes,</actor> <actor>Kendall,</actor> <actor>Houghton,</actor> <actor>Danton,</actor> <actor>Barrett,</actor> <actor>Taylor,</actor> <actor>Collingwood,</actor> &amp;c.</castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Helena,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_gi">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Genevieve,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Bridemaids,</role> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watston</hi>,</actor> <actor>Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               The Publick is respectfully informed, that, The New Play of The <hi rend="allcaps">Royal</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Oak</hi>, was repeated yesterday evening, with increased effect; and, ha-<lb/>
               ving been honour'd with the most unbounded and universal applause,<lb/>
               will be perform'd every night till further notice.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
